&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;As someone who has commuted from Anne Arundel County to both Baltimore and DC for over a decade, every transportation option has been tried. This guide shares what works, what doesn&amp;rsquo;t, and how to choose the right commute for your life.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
