&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Primary Routes Through Anne Arundel County:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Commuting &amp; Transportation in Anne Arundel County</title><link>https://annearundelguide.com/topics/commuting-transportation/</link><pubDate>Mon, 18 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://annearundelguide.com/topics/commuting-transportation/</guid><description>&lt;h1 class="relative group"&gt;Commuting &amp;amp; Transportation in Anne Arundel County
 &lt;div id="commuting--transportation-in-anne-arundel-county" class="anchor"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
 
 &lt;span
 class="absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none"&gt;
 &lt;a class="text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline" href="#commuting--transportation-in-anne-arundel-county" aria-label="Anchor"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
 &lt;/span&gt;
 
&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Estimated reading time: 5 minutes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Living in Anne Arundel County means you&amp;rsquo;re between Baltimore and Washington DC, which is both a blessing and a curse for transportation. You&amp;rsquo;ve got options, but choosing the right ones depends entirely on where you work and how you want to spend your time.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2 class="relative group"&gt;Driving: The Default Option
 &lt;div id="driving-the-default-option" class="anchor"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
 
 &lt;span
 class="absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none"&gt;
 &lt;a class="text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline" href="#driving-the-default-option" aria-label="Anchor"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
 &lt;/span&gt;
 
&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Let&amp;rsquo;s be honest - most people drive here. The county was built around cars, and even though public transit exists, driving is still the primary mode of transportation for the vast majority of residents.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>BWI Airport Guide - Getting There &amp; Using the Rail Station</title><link>https://annearundelguide.com/topics/bwi-guide/</link><pubDate>Mon, 18 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://annearundelguide.com/topics/bwi-guide/</guid><description>&lt;h1 class="relative group"&gt;BWI Airport Guide
 &lt;div id="bwi-airport-guide" class="anchor"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
 
 &lt;span
 class="absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none"&gt;
 &lt;a class="text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline" href="#bwi-airport-guide" aria-label="Anchor"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
 &lt;/span&gt;
 
&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Baltimore-Washington International Thurgood Marshall Airport sits right in Anne Arundel County, which makes it your local airport. That convenience means you&amp;rsquo;re usually 10-20 minutes from terminals depending on where you live in the county.&lt;/p&gt;

